@startuml deployment-architecture
title Sơ đồ Kiến trúc Triển khai Hệ thống (Deployment & Network Architecture) - TourVoice Quận 4
caption Chuẩn hóa: Frontend React (Admin Vite & Mobile Expo) + Backend FastAPI (Router -> Service -> Repository) + MongoDB

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Quản Trị Viên / Chủ Quán\n(React Web Admin - TypeScript + Vite)" as AdminUser
actor "Du Khách Mobile\n(React Native App - Expo / iOS & Android)" as MobileUser
actor "Du Khách Web\n(Web Tourist Client PWA)" as WebTourist

cloud "Internet Công Cộng (Public Network)" as PublicNet {
  node "HTTPS (Port 443) / HTTP (Port 80)" as Ingress
}

node "Máy Chủ VPS (1.55.58.251 / tour.quan4.vn)" {
  
  package "DMZ / Tầng Đảo Nghịch (Reverse Proxy & Static Hosting)" {
    component "Nginx Web Server\n(Port 80 / 443)" as Nginx
    folder "React Web-Admin Bundle\n(apps/web-admin/dist - /admin, /web-admin)" as ReactAdminDist
    folder "Web Tourist Assets\n(frontend/client - /client)" as WebClientAssets
    folder "Media Audio Storage\n(/storage/audio - MP3 files)" as MediaStorage
  }

  package "Tầng Ứng Dụng Backend (FastAPI Server - Port 8000)" {
    component "FastAPI Application (Uvicorn)" as FastAPI {
      port "API Router Layer\n(/api/v1/auth, /pois, /tours, /payments...)" as RouterLayer
      component "Domain Service Layer\n(POI, Tour, Narration, Payment, Analytics)" as ServiceLayer
      component "Repository Layer\n(BaseRepository, POIRepo, AnalyticsRepo...)" as RepoLayer
    }
  }

  package "Tầng Cơ Sở Dữ Liệu & Hàng Đợi (Private Network)" {
    database "MongoDB 7.0 ReplicaSet\n(rs0 - Port 27017)\n[Collections: pois, tours, orders, analytics...]" as MongoDB
    database "Redis 7.2\n(Cache, Token Blacklist, Rate Limiting)" as Redis
    component "OSRM Routing Engine\n(Bản đồ đường bộ Quận 4)" as OSRM
  }
}

cloud "Dịch vụ Bên Thứ Ba (External Cloud Services)" {
  [Google OAuth 2.0 / OIDC] as GoogleAuth
  [Cổng Thanh Toán VietQR / payOS] as VietQR
  [OpenStreetMap / CartoDB CDN] as OSM_CDN
  [Microsoft Edge-TTS / AI Service] as EdgeTTS
}

' Client Connections
AdminUser --> Ingress : Truy cập Cổng Quản trị React (Same-Origin /admin)
MobileUser --> Ingress : Gọi API qua HTTPS Domain (/api/v1/...)
WebTourist --> Ingress : Truy cập Cổng Du khách (/client)

Ingress --> Nginx : Port 80/443

Nginx --> ReactAdminDist : Phục vụ trực tiếp React SPA Bundle (/admin)
Nginx --> WebClientAssets : Phục vụ HTML/CSS/JS Du khách (/client)
Nginx --> MediaStorage : Phục vụ luồng Audio MP3 tĩnh (/storage)
Nginx --> FastAPI : Proxy Pass /api/v1/ (giữ nguyên URI và Headers)

' Internal FastAPI Architecture
RouterLayer --> ServiceLayer : DTO Validation & Dependency Injection
ServiceLayer --> RepoLayer : Business Rules Enforcement (Readiness Gate, Grants)
RepoLayer --> MongoDB : Truy vấn & Transaction (ACID)
ServiceLayer --> Redis : Token Whitelist / Blacklist & Cooldown
ServiceLayer --> OSRM : Tính khoảng cách & cự ly đường bộ

' External Integrations
ServiceLayer --> GoogleAuth : Xác thực Google ID Token & Lấy UserInfo
ServiceLayer --> VietQR : Tạo link mã QR thanh toán hóa đơn
ServiceLayer --> EdgeTTS : Sinh file thuyết minh âm thanh tự động
MobileUser ..> OSM_CDN : Tải bản đồ nền Vector / Raster Tiles
AdminUser ..> OSM_CDN : Tải bản đồ nền tương tác Leaflet

note right of Nginx
  <b>Kiến Trúc Same-Origin:</b>
  - React Web Admin gọi relative <code>/api/v1/...</code>
  - Không phát sinh lỗi CORS Preflight
  - Không vi phạm Private Network Access (PNA loopback)
end note

note bottom of MobileUser
  <b>React Native Mobile Features:</b>
  - LocationService (GPS thực tế, lọc sai số >35m)
  - GeofenceEngine (Bán kính vào/ra, Debounce 3s, Cooldown 5m)
  - NarrationController (Cấp quyền nghe thử Trial & Quản lý vé Tour)
  - AnalyticsOutbox (Lưu ngoại tuyến & Gửi batch kèm per-item ACK)
end note

@enduml
